text-[11px] font-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Systems Integration</span><span class=\"bg-[#EEEEFF] border-2 border-[#6366F1] text-[#6366F1] text-[11px] font-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">AI</span></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-[#0B0B0B] border-[4px] border-black rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200\"><div class=\"absolute top-7 right-7 rotate-[6deg]\"><div class=\"border-[3px] border-[#FFC224] rounded-lg px-3 py-1\"><span class=\"text-[#FFC224] text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest\">Completed</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><img src=\"https://www.ituniversity-mg.com/page/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/ITU_logo_MAJ_negatif_sans_fond.png\" alt=\"IT University Madagascar\" class=\"h-10 w-auto object-contain mb-3\"/><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3 h-3 text-[#888]\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#888] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">Antananarivo, Madagascar</span></div></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-[28px] font-black text-white mb-2 leading-tight\">Bachelor&#x27;s Degree<br/>in Computer Science</h3><p class=\"text-[#FFC224] font-bold text-sm mb-4\">Software Engineering &amp; Development</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-4 h-4 text-[#666]\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-[#aaa] font-medium\">2020 – 2023</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-[#FFC224] border-2 border-[#FFC224] text-black text-[11px] font-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Very Good Mention</span><span class=\"bg-white/10 border-2 border-white/20 text-white/70 text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Algorithms</span><span class=\"bg-white/10 border-2 border-white/20 text-white/70 text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Databases</span><span class=\"bg-white/10 border-2 border-white/20 text-white/70 text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Networks</span><span class=\"bg-white/10 border-2 border-white/20 text-white/70 text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">OOP</span></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-[#FF6B7A] border-[4px] border-black rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] flex items-center gap-5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-white border-2 border-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap w-7 h-7 text-[#FF6B7A]\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-white/70 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">IT University Madagascar · Since 2023</p><h4 class=\"text-white font-black text-xl leading-tight\">Bacc+4 in Computer Science</h4></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#FFC224] border-[4px] border-black rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] flex items-center gap-5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-black border-2 border-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-7 h-7 text-[#FFC224]\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-black/50 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Recognition · Accès Banque</p><h4 class=\"text-black font-black text-xl leading-tight\">Award — Banking &amp; Finance</h4></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-32\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-10 md:mb-14\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4\">Beyond the<!-- --> <span class=\"bg-[#6366F1] text-white px-3 py-1 inline-block\">code</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">What stacks don&#x27;t capture — but what truly makes the difference.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-8\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#6366F1] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Leadership</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\">Leading isn&#x27;t about title — it&#x27;s about making the people around you better. I invest in teammates, share knowledge freely, and contribute to an engineering culture built to last.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#2F81F7] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Collaboration</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\">I thrive in cross-functional environments. Whether working with product, design, or business, I adapt quickly and make sure everyone is moving in the same direction.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#FF6B7A] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Communication</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\">I&#x27;ve learned that the best technical solution means nothing if you can&#x27;t explain it. I naturally bridge the gap between code and conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#FFC224] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Problem Solving</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\">I don&#x27;t just fix what&#x27;s broken — I find out why it broke. I balance speed with sustainability, and I own my trade-offs with full awareness of their consequences.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#FF4A60] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Strategic Vision</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\">I think beyond the ticket. Every architecture choice, every refactor, every API design — I always ask how it serves the bigger picture.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#0B0B0B] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Ownership &amp; Commitment</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\">I don&#x27;t ship a project into the void and hope it holds. From scoping to deployment, I stay close to what I build and take full responsibility for it.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div id=\"about\"><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-32\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-lg aspect-square border-[4px] border-black rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-[#FF6B6B] shadow-[-8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\"><img alt=\"About me illustration\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/about-me.svg\"/></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6 md:space-y-8\"><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4\">Who&#x27;s behind all this <span class=\"bg-[#2F81F7] text-white px-3 py-1 inline-block\">great work?</span></h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed\">Friendly, autonomous, and serious developer who acquires new skills rapidly. Bilingual in English and French, passionate about tech, and driven to lead impactful projects.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#6366F1] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\">4+ years of professional experience</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\">From Java/JEE banking apps to AI-powered accessibility tools and FinTech payment platforms.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#FF6B7A] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\">10+ technologies mastered</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\">Java Spring, Next.js, Python, TypeScript, Odoo, FastAPI, LLMs, Docker, PostgreSQL, and more.</p></div></div></div><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 bg-[#0B0B0B] text-white hover:bg-black/90 rounded-lg py-5 px-8 md:py-[22px] md:px-[62px] text-base md:text-lg font-semibold h-auto w-full sm:w-auto sm:min-w-[240px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>More about me</button></div></div></section></div><div id=\"portfolio\"><section class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4\">Take a look at my <br/><span class=\"bg-[#FFC224] text-black px-3 py-1 inline-block\">portfolio</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"group bg-white border-[3px] border-black rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"bg-[#6366F1] relative overflow-hidden h-48 flex-shrink-0\"><img alt=\"Online Payment Platform — Ibonia FinTech\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/studio-workspace.svg\"/></div><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-1\"><span class=\"inline-block bg-black text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 w-fit\">FinTech / Backend</span><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2 leading-tight text-[#0B0B0B]\">Online Payment Platform — Ibonia FinTech</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#555] mb-5 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Generic payment API unifying Mobile Money (local) and Visa/Mastercard (international) transactions. Includes an event ticketing and registration engine for trail running events.</p><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#0B0B0B] hover:gap-3 transition-all text-sm\">View case study<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white border-[3px] border-black rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"bg-[#2F81F7] relative overflow-hidden h-48 flex-shrink-0\"><img alt=\"SensAI — AI Accessibility App\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/venture-workspace.svg\"/></div><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-1\"><span class=\"inline-block bg-black text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 w-fit\">AI / Mobile</span><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2 leading-tight text-[#0B0B0B]\">SensAI — AI Accessibility App</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#555] mb-5 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Mobile accessibility app for deaf and blind users. Blind mode: YOLOv8 object detection, OCR, voice commands. Deaf mode: audio transcription, YAMNet sound classification, LLM summarization.</p><a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#0B0B0B] hover:gap-3 transition-all text-sm\">View case study<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white border-[3px] border-black rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"bg-[#FF6B7A] relative overflow-hidden h-48 flex-shrink-0\"><img alt=\"Antema — Church Worship Presentation Software\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/studio-workspace.svg\"/></div><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-1\"><span class=\"inline-block bg-black text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 w-fit\">Desktop / Tauri</span><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2 leading-tight text-[#0B0B0B]\">Antema — Church Worship Presentation Software</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#555] mb-5 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Desktop app replacing PowerPoint for church worship. Manages and displays song lyrics, liturgy, and holy songs with a slide presentation interface. Database-driven, purpose-built for church communities — eliminating the pain of recreating slides every service.</p><a href=\"https://github.com/Antema-MG/Antema\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#0B0B0B] hover:gap-3 transition-all text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-github w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4\"></path><path d=\"M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2\"></path></svg>View on GitHub</a></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white border-[3px] border-black rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col\"><div class=\"bg-[#FFC224] relative overflow-hidden h-48 flex-shrink-0\"><img alt=\"Solfa Reader — Choral Music Player &amp; Score Viewer\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/venture-workspace.svg\"/></div><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-1\"><span class=\"inline-block bg-black text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 w-fit\">Web / Music</span><h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2 leading-tight text-[#0B0B0B]\">Solfa Reader — Choral Music Player &amp; Score Viewer</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#555] mb-5 leading-relaxed flex-1\">Web-based player and viewer for .msolfa — a custom plain-text format for 4-voice SATB choral music in relative solfège. Real-time Web Audio synthesis, per-voice mute/solo, transpose, tempo control, interactive piano display. Built for Malagasy church music.</p><a href=\"https://github.com/Antema-MG/solfa-reader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#0B0B0B] hover:gap-3 transition-all text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" f