0 text-sm md:text-base\",\"children\":\"Leading isn't about title — it's about making the people around you better. I invest in teammates, share knowledge freely, and contribute to an engineering culture built to last.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Collaboration\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#2F81F7] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Collaboration\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\",\"children\":\"I thrive in cross-functional environments. Whether working with product, design, or business, I adapt quickly and make sure everyone is moving in the same direction.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Communication\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#FF6B7A] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Communication\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\",\"children\":\"I've learned that the best technical solution means nothing if you can't explain it. I naturally bridge the gap between code and conversation.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Problem Solving\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#FFC224] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Problem Solving\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\",\"children\":\"I don't just fix what's broken — I find out why it broke. I balance speed with sustainability, and I own my trade-offs with full awareness of their consequences.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Strategic Vision\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#FF4A60] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Strategic Vision\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\",\"children\":\"I think beyond the ticket. Every architecture choice, every refactor, every API design — I always ask how it serves the bigger picture.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Ownership & Commitment\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#0B0B0B] border-2 border-black rounded-[5px] flex-shrink-0 mt-1\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2\",\"children\":\"Ownership & Commitment\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base\",\"children\":\"I don't ship a project into the void and hope it holds. From scoping to deployment, I stay close to what I build and take full responsibility for it.\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"about\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-32\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex justify-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-full max-w-lg aspect-square border-[4px] border-black rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-[#FF6B6B] shadow-[-8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/about-me.svg\",\"alt\":\"About me illustration\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-6 md:space-y-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",